= DVP leaves the Grand Coalition!

With our disagreements heightened to the point of no return, DVP has declared they would leave the coalition!

Disgrace for them, but perhaps, our coalition faces the collapse. Even with majority, BVP won't agree to remain in coalition without bourgeouise counterweight.
